<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Marvel cut to nearterm reduce.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Marvel cut to nearterm reduce.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut its rating of Marvel Entertainment Group Inc on Wednesday to a near-term reduce from its previous rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock remains a long-term neutral, Merrill said.</p>
<p>-- Marvel shares closed at eight on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
